    \item \textbf{Valence} $V(t) \in [-1, 1]$ — positive/negative emotional tone
\end{itemize}
\end{definition}

In the absence of regulation, arousal evolves according to:
$$\frac{dA}{dt} = \alpha \cdot S(t) - \beta \cdot A(t)$$
where:
